WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.358
Install RIVL without an App Store release. This illustrated guide uses SideStore and
your own free Apple account. You need a computer for setup, and you must refresh the
apps before seven days expire.

2
00:00:12.758 --> 00:00:26.172
Have your iPhone, a USB cable, a computer, Wi-Fi, and your Apple account ready. If
you already use RIVL, export your workouts first. Keep your existing app until you
have verified the transfer.

3
00:00:26.572 --> 00:00:40.540
Open the official SideStore documentation at docs dot sidestore dot io. Follow its
current prerequisites to get iLoader for your computer and LocalDevVPN for your
phone. The VPN helper may require an App Store download.

4
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:53.741
Connect and unlock your iPhone. Trust the computer when asked. In iLoader, choose
Install SideStore, Stable, and complete the Apple account steps yourself. Follow the
official guide if any screen differs.

5
00:00:54.141 --> 00:01:07.402
On your phone, follow the official guide to trust the developer app and enable
Developer Mode if required. Restart if prompted. Connect LocalDevVPN, then open
SideStore and sign in with the same Apple account.

6
00:01:07.802 --> 00:01:18.238
While connected to Wi-Fi and LocalDevVPN, open My Apps in SideStore and refresh
SideStore once. Complete this initial refresh before installing RIVL.

7
00:01:18.638 --> 00:01:32.885
Open the GitHub release linked below this video and save RIVL dot IPA to Files on
your iPhone. In SideStore, open My Apps, tap the plus button, and select that file.
Let SideStore finish signing and installing it.

8
00:01:33.285 --> 00:01:49.680
Open RIVL and sign in. Choose the permissions you need. This download contains the
iPhone app only. After re-signing, check Health access and a short GPS recording
before relying on it for a workout. These capabilities still need validation on your
signed installation.

9
00:01:50.080 --> 00:02:07.974
Refresh both RIVL and SideStore before their seven day counters expire. Use Wi-Fi and
LocalDevVPN. Background refresh can fail, so check the countdown. Free accounts allow
three apps including SideStore. Pairing problems or iOS updates may require your
computer again.

10
00:02:08.374 --> 00:02:23.406
The release, written guide, and official SideStore links are at github dot com slash
OjayitTanwar slash rivl. If installation fails, use the troubleshooting steps in the
guide. Keep your current RIVL data backed up while changing installers.
